<%--
Rsx_Tab

Individual tab component that integrates with Rsx_Tabs for form-aware error handling.

$id - Tab identifier (used for URL hash and targeting)
$label - Tab label text
$icon - Optional Bootstrap icon class (e.g., "bi-building")

Features:
- Automatically registers with parent Rsx_Tabs component
- Counts validation errors in child Form_Field components
- Renders as Bootstrap tab pane
- Works independently or within Rsx_Tabs container

Usage:
<Rsx_Tabs>
    <Rsx_Tab $sid="basic-info" $label="Basic Information" $icon="bi-building">
        <Form_Field $label="Name"><Text_Input $name="name" /></Form_Field>
    </Rsx_Tab>
    <Rsx_Tab $sid="address" $label="Address" $icon="bi-geo-alt">
        <Form_Field $label="Street"><Text_Input $name="street" /></Form_Field>
    </Rsx_Tab>
</Rsx_Tabs>
--%>
<Define:Rsx_Tab class="tab-pane fade" role="tabpanel">
    <%= content() %>
</Define:Rsx_Tab>
